        "renderShape": {
          "kind": "markdown"
        },
        "markdown": "# Mark Burnett\n\nBritish-American television producer whose credits include **Survivor**, **The Apprentice**, **Shark Tank**, and **The Voice**. Burnett later led MGM Television and, beginning in 2025, served as the U.S. special envoy to the United Kingdom.\n\nThis graph separates his documented television and diplomatic career from claims made in **Bride of Charlie**.",
        "view": {
          "intent": "graph",
          "payload": "graph.web.detail"
        },
        "label": "Mark Burnett Profile"
